        "cooked": "<details>\n<summary>\nScreenshot</summary>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db\" title=\"20221023180755_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20221023180755_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"f7Pu2ZpQ2TeoiJ2tNdCXuJ1DcqD\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6a0335357cba65c710c9fb7d24c73ccd528ac6db_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20221023180755_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 419 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n</details>\n<p>No ongoing/environment destruction plus limited AOE plus Bunker made this tricky and slow, I did get lucky with the environment never playing any Crystalloid Behemoths though.</p>",
