        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-10-23T19:47:41.454Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I used to underestimate AB a lot; the bonus card plays from the Environment can really, really hurt.  Instant Entomb when you have four heroes damageable and one happens to be immune, or Primeval Eruption into Disrupt the Field on side B, triggering several additional plays including another Eruption… she really gives you the feeling of a volcano that sits there doing nothing for decades and then suddenly explodes.  I used to use her as one of my go-to villains for teaching new players the game, but that was before the app showed me just how out of control she can get.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2022-10-23T19:47:41.454Z",
