        "id": 248873,
        "name": "",
        "username": "The_Justifier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_justifier/{size}/4954_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-10-24T02:58:20.843Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Arboreal Phalanges is just damage (at least in the EE version).  You may be thinking of Entangling Brambles.  And I agree, those are always a priority target.  If you get down to 1 or 2 heroes, a Bramble or two can basically give you a nonstandard Game Over even though you never actually die.  I have an awesome game report involving Scholar that I need to finish up and post sometime, where he and his multi-iron form waited out like 50 turns of AB keeping him paralyzed but unharmed, until finally the Environment got around to killing her.</p>",
